Why Is Demand Increasing
Space Solar Applications: Germanium substrates remain important for multi-junction space solar cells because of their compatibility with III-V materials and suitability for demanding satellite environments.
Infrared and Photonic Devices: High infrared transparency and other material characteristics support applications in infrared optics, photonics, specialty detectors, and related technologies.
Advanced Semiconductor Integration: Increasing use of germanium wafers in specialty semiconductor structures and research platforms is supporting demand for high-quality epi-ready substrates.

Germanium Substrates Market Watch: Recycling and Reusable Wafer Technologies
The market is increasingly focused on material efficiency, substrate recovery, larger wafer formats, and application-specific qualification. Reusable germanium substrates and lift-off approaches can reduce material consumption, while advanced crystal growth, wafer polishing, doping, and surface preparation are helping suppliers meet increasingly demanding customer specifications.

